	| Product Type                           | New                                        |
	| Renewal                                | false                                      |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Key             | ${staticSalesforceOpportunityKey}          |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Line Item Key 1 | ${staticSalesforceOpportunityLineItemKey1} |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Sold By         | Liferay US                                 |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Stage Name      | Closed Won                                 |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Territory       | United States                              |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Type            | New Business                               |
	| Salesforce Owner User Key              | ${staticSalesforceOwnerUserKey}            |
	| Start Day                              | ${staticStartDay}                          |
	| Start Month                            | ${staticStartMonth}                        |
	| Start Year                             | ${staticStartYear}                         |
	And I synchronize the account entitlement definition with the name "Partner"
	# Necessary pause for email sync
	And I wait for "10" seconds
	When I log into the provisioning homepage as "${staticProvisioningAdminEmailAddress}" with password "${staticProvisioningAdminPassword}"
	And I go to the account index page
	And I search the accounts page using the keyword "Prmail"
	And I click on the account with the name "Prmail - ${staticCompanyName}" on the provisioning index
	And I click on the "Contacts" tab
	And I click on the assign contact button
	And I populate and save the assign contact form with the following values
	| Email Address | pro.user3@lrpartner.com.broken |
	| Assign Role   | Partner Manager                |
	And I synchronize the contact entitlement definition with the name "Partner"
	And I go the support email message in MockMock where the sender is "Liferay Provisioning" the recipient is "PRO ${staticContactLastName3}" with the email address "pro.user3@lrpartner.com.broken" and the message content contains the text "New Liferay Project Invitation - Prmail - ${staticCompanyName}"
	Then I should be able to view the email message containing the following text 
